 out any options that get me to the blank Trinity character sheets.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-21T20:14:38-07:00","id":1479273,"title":"","content":"Hey guys, Update 7 is ready <b>ONLY TESTING ROOM</b> for now <b>(since TC:Anima is not officially released yet)</b><br /> <br /> <br /> 1- Developed<br /> ANIMA Sheet<br /> GLASS Theme<br /> <br /> <br /> 2- Expanded<br /> Added description in Path Contacts<br /> Added Path Status: Active, Suspended, Revoked<br /> Added Story Tab in Paths<br /> <br /> <br /> <div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/084gcpdle0rrqyz/Anima%20Sheet.png?raw=1\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> <div align=\"center\"><br /> Anima Sheet<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/m7xofetpmqpv71p/Sheet%20Theme.png?raw=1\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Glass Theme<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/kafcwljv2hh9bl6/Path%20Status2.png?raw=1\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Path Status<br /> </div> <div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/lakkyloydr909k6/Contact%20Description.png?raw=1\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Path Contacts Description</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I created around 20 characters for testing. You can use them...if you need more, just talk.<br /> <br /> If you want to use the Sheet, just get in touch and I'll create a room with the sheet. It would be nice for the feedbacks.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>The room link is:</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://app.roll20.net/join/10870153/X81x-Q\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:24px\">https://app.roll20.net/join/10870153/X81x-Q</span></b></a><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-22T05:49:07-07:00","id":1479292,"title":"","content":"The Anima sheet looks gorgeous!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-22T06:55:56-07:00","id":1479294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1454279-character-sheet-trinity-continnum-character-sheet-project-for-roll-20?p=1479239#post1479239\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I guess I'm just dumb because I don't know how to do that. I launch the game which sends to an editor but I cannot to save my life figure out any options that get me to the blank Trinity character sheets.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Here is a link to a video made by Roll20 about how to select a character sheet template for your campaign. You'll want to select &quot;Trinity Continuum 2e&quot; for the character sheet template.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ffhfuMFflX4\" data-code=\"ffhfuMFflX4\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ffhfuMFflX4/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> If you don't know how to setup a campaign in roll20 this video goes over it (and you can define the character sheet template selection during that step)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IoyQs0Cv4p0\" data-code=\"IoyQs0Cv4p0\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/IoyQs0Cv4p0/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-22T08:18:21-07:00","id":1479301,"title":"","content":"It looks Amazing! To be fair I didn\u2019t went too deep in the rules for anima, but\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-23T12:44:41-07:00","id":1487642,"title":"","content":"Hey guys, Update 8 is ready<br /> <br /> 1- Turn Public from Update 7<br /> -Added description in Path Contacts<br /> -Added Path Status: Active, Suspended, Revoked<br /> -GLASS Theme<br /> <br /> 2- Developed<br /> -Option to make Equipments (Gears, Weapons and Armors) as Template. Improving the handling of these equipments. This way you can transfer equipment to a teammate without having to rewrite the stats on his sheet.<br /> -Naming System to Equipments, Vehicles and Vargs<br /> <br /> 3- Bug Fixes<br /> -Some incorrect terms and names.<br /> -Aptitude Proxy Level now expand correctly<br /> -NPC Power dot (with Generic Source) can now be filled correctly <div align=\"center\"><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> </div> <div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/i4nvu043at9jbwl/Weapon.png?raw=1\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> </div> <div align=\"center\">Equipment: Weapon<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/hk0i9026v43gccp/Armor.png?raw=1\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Equipment: Armor<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/pu8ffhsbbsa4u6e/Gear.png?raw=1\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Equipment: Gear</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> I created around 20 characters for testing. You can use them...if you need more, just talk.<br /> If you want to use the Sheet, just get in touch and I'll create a room with the sheet. It would be nice for the feedbacks.<br /> <br /> The room link is:<br /> <span style=\"font-size:22px\"><b><a href=\"https://app.roll20.net/join/10870153/X81x-Q\" target=\"_blank\">https://app.roll20.net/join/10870153/X81x-Q</a></b></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-04T14:43:20-07:00","id":1489157,"title":"","content":"Thoughts on updates for Assassin (All it would really need is changing the word &quot;Gifts&quot; to Masteries and using the purple theme), Anima sheets for the virtual characters, and an update for Aether (currently no green theme, plus no support for the Squire/Gog/Magog delineations)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/912-gamer-n-geek","name":"Gamer N. Geek","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-05T19:58:32-07:00","id":1489295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gamer N. Geek</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1454279-character-sheet-trinity-continnum-character-sheet-project-for-roll-20?p=1489157#post1489157\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thoughts on updates for Assassin (All it would really need is changing the word &quot;Gifts&quot; to Masteries and using the purple theme), Anima sheets for the virtual characters, and an update for Aether (currently no green theme, plus no support for the Squire/Gog/Magog delineations)?</div> </div> </div> </div>I just start to use the sheet - and I must say I'm more than impressed with work you here done! Seen at least dozen of sheets on Roll20 - and this one is one most complex and wholesome of all!<br /> <br /> I can comment more in coming weeks - but on first read, it seems that you are correct about those changes for <b>Assassins</b>, <b>Anima</b> and <b>Aether</b> variants. \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> One question - <b>What is <i>Jinkatsu</i> in Type on sheet?</b> From what book it is?<br /> <br /> General comment to sheet - <b>Allegiance</b> are only in half of books/eras - other call those groups simply as <b>Societies</b>. For examples Societies are in <b>Assassins </b>and <b>Aether</b> gamelines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-06T03:38:03-07:00","id":1489307,"title":"","content":"Jinketsu is the Japanese word for Hero, or Great man, and is the original name of Superiors from Aexpanssion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-14T10:21:00-07:00","id":1490145,"title":"","content":"Some thoughts after doing character creation with players using your sheet. There is lack for<b><i>Moment of Inspiration</i> section</b> - and more important, you have <b>no XP counting section</b> - which is a problem in longer chronicle. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-14T12:45:23-07:00","id":1490160,"title":"","content":"Regarding the Moment of Inspiration. I think it can be better placed in the Character's Notes or Bio. <br /> <br /> Regarding XP. There were intense discussions with my brother about this. But decide not to put them on. Because I read somewhere in the Roll-20 documentation that they forbid any progression system in community created sheets. It's true that I've seen sheets created by fans, which have the XP progression session, but I decided not to risk it. But you can easily fix this lack by putting your XP in Notes.<br /> <br /> Thank you very much for the feedback!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date: