ng <b>Gen</b> button then...</div> </div> </div> </div>You can use Custom Rolls in the Rolls tab to &quot;build&quot; your Initiative Roll","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-03T13:47:34-07:00","id":1494260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>literatzi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1454279-character-sheet-trinity-continnum-character-sheet-project-for-roll-20?p=1494209#post1494209\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Really amazing work on this! Any plans to add other aliens, or a generic Alien type before you move on?</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately no <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ... I still want to do Cybernetics and Noetic Tech... but we'll see...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join D