div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1454279-character-sheet-trinity-continnum-character-sheet-project-for-roll-20?p=1500078#post1500078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The MMN says &quot;symbols this week... then it'll be ready.&quot;<br /> <br /> That's not the same thing as &quot;ready this week.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mike is and has been working on finishing up the various symbols this week. And when he's done with those (he's not yet) then it'll be ready for the next step in the process.<br /> <br /> Will backers be getting the backer PDF soon? Probably. Was it going to be this week? Unlikely.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1454279-character-sheet-trinity-continnum-character-sheet-project-for-roll-20?p=1500161#post1500161\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... And I was right - TC Adventure! goes today to backers - so in month, two we will have official release. \ud83d\ude0e</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> You were right? ...Unlikely.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26537,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","user":"Jonnes.Derik","date":". 12-20-2022, 12:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-23T00:30:00-08:00","id":1501122,"title":"","content":"Hey guys, Update 10 is ready!<br /> <br /> <b>1- New Power Suite Color System</b> - In addition to being able to select Tags (of the Quantum Traits) and describe the Power Suite relationships, you can now change the colors of the Quantum Traits to reflect these relationships in Description Tab.<br /> <br /> <b>2- New Skin - Paramorph II -</b> This skin will be the default skin for Trinity Continuum: Adventure Templates!<br /> <br /> <b>3- New Custom roll button (and Custom Initiative roll) on the main tab -</b> These buttons give access to the Main Tab, the first 15 Custom rolls. In this area, these Rolls will NOT be editable. Such edits can be made on the Roll Tab.<br /> <br /> <b>4- New NPC Section: Modifiers and Conditions</b> - By default they are invisible in the Options tab.<br /> <br /> <b>5- New Nova Section: Mega Attribute Alternative -</b> An alternative section for Mega Attributes, more practical and efficient, using the same architecture as the other Quantum Traits (Mega Edges and Quantum Powers). ATTENTION, this section does not inherit data from the legacy Mega Attribute Section. By default they are invisible in the Options tab.<br /> <br /> <b>6- Date and time on the Rolling result\u200b</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Future Updates<br /> <br /> <b>1- Working on the printable version. I already anticipate that there will be some setbacks</b> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/8n0habeh9bkz5y5/Screenshot_4.png?raw=1\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/8n0habeh9