/main-forum/trinity/1454279-character-sheet-trinity-continnum-character-sheet-project-for-roll-20?p=1501192#post1501192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Campaigns using sheet to this date are automatically updated? Or do I need to reset the sheets settings in my game?</div> </div> </div> </div>Automatically updated ^^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-05T10:50:34-08:00","id":1502221,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar26537_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26537\" data-vbnamecard=\"26537\">Jonnes.Derik</a> There is error on time paramters by rolling on NPC sheets variants.<br /> <br /> <img width=\"544\" height=\"405\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ONGkXu8.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/ONGkXu8.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/ONGkXu8.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/blob:https://imgur.com/c331599a-a24b-4c5c-ba62-ca0e8e012244\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/blob:https://imgur.com/c331599a-a24b-4c5c-ba62-ca0e8e012244\" data-thumb-url=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/blob:https://imgur.com/c331599a-a24b-4c5c-ba62-ca0e8e012244&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-05T15:11:14-08:00","id":1502249,"title":"","content":"Problem found. In the next update it will be fixed.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Until then, here's what you should do as a palliative.:<br /> <br /> 1 - Change the character to the Baseline template<br /> <br /> 2- Do a Core Roll (can be with zero dice - <i>[to initialize the variable</i>])<br /> <br /> 3- Return to the NPC template. The problem will be solved.\u200b<br /> <br /> <br /> Thanks a lot for the Feedback..\u200b<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-05T21:23:37-08:00","id":1502281,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jonnes.Derik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1454279-character-sheet-trinity-continnum-character-sheet-project-for-roll-20?p=1502249#post1502249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks a lot for the Feedback..\u200b<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>It's nothing game breaking - and seen only by me as GM. So will leave my NPCs stats in peace. <br /> <br /> More dire looking thing for yours almost perfect sheet - <b>Ability to title one-time Core rolls.</b> My group made work around writing again after the roll what it was made for - like 'hacking the door' ie 'convincing the Mayor' - but putting it in the rolls box itself would be a blessing!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-02T15:38:40-07:00","id":1543032,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#c0392b\"><b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Roll-20 is experiencing technical issues. As far as I know, most sheets are affected. The issue has been occurring for a few weeks now. The Roll-20 Team is working to resolve it quickly (or so they said).</span></b></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-02T20:27:33-07:00","id":1543044,"title":"","content":"We run the Aeon game on your sheets last week - and they worked fine for us. Maybe we got lucky. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}